{"type":"standard","title":"Sean Casten","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sean Casten</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q55386655","titles":{"canonical":"Sean_Casten","normalized":"Sean Casten","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sean Casten</span></span>"},"pageid":58920903,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Sean_Casten_Headshot_117th_Congress.jpeg/330px-Sean_Casten_Headshot_117th_Congress.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/Sean_Casten_Headshot_117th_Congress.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1536,"height":1920},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374192169","tid":"c61afb59-ad0e-11f1-9b18-d24e6659fd36","timestamp":"2026-09-10T11:57:19Z","description":"American politician (born 1971)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_Casten","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_Casten?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_Casten?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sean_Casten"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_Casten","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Sean_Casten","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_Casten?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sean_Casten"}},"extract":"Sean Thomas Casten is an American businessman and politician serving as the U.S. representative for Illinois's 6th congressional district since 2019. The district covers southwestern Chicago, as well as many of Chicago's inner southwestern suburbs, such as Downers Grove, Wheaton, Lisle, Orland Park, and Western Springs. He is a member of the Democratic Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Sean Thomas Casten</b> is an American businessman and politician serving as the U.S. representative for Illinois's 6th congressional district since 2019. The district covers southwestern Chicago, as well as many of Chicago's inner southwestern suburbs, such as Downers Grove, Wheaton, Lisle, Orland Park, and Western Springs. He is a member of the Democratic Party.</p>"}